[b][font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/28.tres]史实 vs 演义[/font][/b]


[b][font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/26.tres]演义设定[/font][/b]


演义将成廉纳入「吕布八健将」体系（正史无此说），设定为张辽统领下的部将。

[color=#000000]毛本第12回[/color]（「陶恭祖三让徐州 曹孟德大战吕布」）：


[indent][color=#666666]┃ 吕布纵马赶来，炮响处，堤内伏兵尽出。[color=#0066FF][url={"research": "夏侯惇", "cat": "people"}]夏侯惇[/url][/color]、[color=#0066FF][url={"research": "夏侯渊", "cat": "people"}]夏侯渊[/url][/color]、[color=#0066FF][url={"research": "许褚", "cat": "people"}]许褚[/url][/color]、[color=#0066FF][url={"research": "典韦", "cat": "people"}]典韦[/url][/color]、[color=#0066FF][url={"research": "李典", "cat": "people"}]李典[/url][/color]、[color=#0066FF][url={"research": "乐进", "cat": "people"}]乐进[/url][/color]，骤马杀来。吕布料敌不过，落荒而走。从将[color=#000000]成廉，被乐进一箭射死[/color]。[/color][/indent]


嘉靖本对应段落与毛本基本一致，成廉被乐进射死。


[b][font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/26.tres]关键差异[/font][/b]


